WEBVTT

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:55.380
I see...

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:59.830
However, you still haven't solved the problem of refinement purity.

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.570
Moreover, the direction of the crystals is still irregular.

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:04.870
Even so, it's greater than the control value.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.570
That's the limit of what we can do with our equipment.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:11.580
My MAX products are of higher quality than the regular item.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:15.250
I cannot accept any crude fakes.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.840
Retake it.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:21.920
What? A raid!? Don't tell me it's GOTT!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.920
That's right.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.590
This is a GOTT compulsory investigation,

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.500
on suspicion of the illegal production

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.690
and sale of the gravity control medium, "Hi-G."

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.870
W- why, you!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:41.030
GOTT, ES members Alv...

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.540
...and Dvergr...

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.670
Shoot them! Shoot them! What are you doing!?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.570
So this is what was confiscated, huh?

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.580
This is a pretty big container to be holding Hi-G.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.910
Hey, watch yourself there!

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:18.880
Right.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:24.480
Jealousy is not becoming. They may be ES members like us,

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:26.910
but they're S-Class, much higher than we are.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.850
I'm not jealous! It's just that their attitude rubs me the wrong way!

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:36.810
If you had abilities proportional to theirs, you would not feel so indignant.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:41.860
It was... empty?

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:45.200
Yes, according to the report.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.530
Really?

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:50.540
Y- yes. There was also nothing found wrong with the seal.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.210
Of course not!

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:57.070
<i>A decoy? A trap? Have we been outwitted?</i>

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:02.550
Mercredi, report this incident to Tweedledee and Tweedledum.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:04.550
Wait, please!

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:06.690
We are the ones who are disgraced,

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.650
and we would prefer to be the ones to clear our names.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.230
Is that so?

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.490
Well then, I shall assign you to support duty.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.230
R- right...

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.230
Call in Éclair and Lumiere.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:24.970
Yes, Chief. I will also call Auditor Armbrust.

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:37.850
The binary stars Latium and Latinus.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.550
Around them orbiting at minimum distance is

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:42.520
the artificial detention camp "Globe-Cage."

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:47.530
The members of MAX that were taken into custody have been imprisoned here.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:51.200
I didn't come all the way out here just to hear a situation report.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.870
I don't remember asking you to come with us.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.870
If it weren't for the chief's orders, I wouldn't have come at all...

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.870
Did you say something?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:02.880
N- no, it's nothing at all.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.210
You <i>did</i> say something, didn't you?

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.480
No, I didn't.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:18.560
At this bare minimum orbit, I'm surprised it hasn't all melted away.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.760
That's because there's a 30-times-normal-gravity

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.560
control buffer in place.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.900
And if this control system were to go wrong?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.200
Then the detention camp would turn into a crematorium.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.070
That's looking after the details, huh?

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.860
Would it be okay if I remained here?

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:55.200
What's wrong?

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.860
The ship's guidance system was working normally,

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:01.540
but ordinarily, the prison guards would be here dealing with us, right?

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:05.870
You don't suppose they have a nap after lunch, do you?

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.540
What were you expecting?

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.550
If you guys aren't coming, we're leaving you behind.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.780
As if not coming with us is part of your job.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.880
Suit yourself, my negligent auditor.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.010
Hmph!

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.510
It's just a cleaner.

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:52.680
First the Hi-G, now the detention camp is empty? That is one nasty trick.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:06.630
Do you find dead bodies to be all that uncommon?

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.270
Lumiere?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:23.480
I feel so... heavy...

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:36.020
l- it must be... a gravity bomb...

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:57.880
Alv, your Reflex.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.530
Hmph, nothing but childish tricks.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.770
In any case, any live witnesses that were supposed to have

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.530
been held here have been silenced now.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:18.540
Our work here is finished. Let's withdraw.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:19.870
Hold on!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.210
You could help us here, couldn't you?

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:27.810
I've never heard of any ES members that needed help out of something like this!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.820
Where is it? The gravity bomb?

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.330
A physical... shield!

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:12.320
Take care of yourselves, ladies.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.870
Lumiere!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:28.540
I'm... okay... I just... found it...

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:32.710
It may be... too late... though...

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:39.710
It finally stopped, huh?

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.490
It's coming apart.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:48.160
Use a gravity bomb inside here twice, and that's only natural.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:52.500
The Svärd! Our ship is gone!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.520
It was that man!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:07.210
Too bad. You won't be able to make it in time now.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.660
Somehow, I made it in time...

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:03.240
Looks like things have gotten considerably more fragile.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.700
Lumiere!

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.340
Lumiere...

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:28.660
We girls should be elegant.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.200
What's the matter?

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:39.140
The ship says it wants to save them.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:51.040
The ship...

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:03.220
La Muse!

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:06.700
She came for us!

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.590
Armbrust!?

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:35.530
He's the one who made off with the Hi-G, as well as the one who stole our ship.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.860
He couldn't have... Why that rotten!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.920
There's a message as well.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:44.870
The seal hasn't been broken.

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:48.210
We know what it says without reading it, don't we?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.210
She's right.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.440
I'm reading it.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:09.560
Choosing a place like this to make the exchange...

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:13.230
You certainly do have classical tastes, huh?

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:16.240
I expected as much from an official of the Global Union.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.260
You're right on time, Magician.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:28.580
My nickname is "The Wizard." Boorish, isn't it? Is that a 3-D image?

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:32.520
In my world, the secret to living a long life is to become a coward.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.860
Those MAX fellows did not know that.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.190
So then, that gravity bomb was indeed...

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.590
A test of the goods.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:45.530
From gravity bombs to gravity mines, when it comes to Shopper,

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:49.540
as long as there's enough raw material, we can mass produce whatever you want.

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.000
You mean like Hi-G?

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:06.650
Indeed. It appears to be the genuine article, in an inert state,

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:09.220
with a gravitational deviation of zero-point-two.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.560
It's high-quality, and the amount is sufficient.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:15.560
You appear to be satisfied.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.630
Are you sure you wouldn't rather build an artificial gravity system,

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:21.900
instead of a weapon?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.840
That was an amusing joke.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:27.240
If you know of any goods that bring more money than weapons, you let me know.

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:30.580
The higher the profit your business brings, the more danger is involved in it.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.100
Or didn't they teach you that in school?

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.920
Ta-da~a!

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:42.860
I knew it had to be something like this!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:48.190
Lies and betrayal may be your special recipe, but I have had my fill already!

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.860
You're here early.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:53.420
She ordered me to escort you.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:02.880
Well, well, I'm quite grateful for the VIP treatment.

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:06.070
Is this supposed to be a trap, Magician?

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:16.220
Donnerschlag, take care of this swindler for me!

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:18.210
That's "Wizard."

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:31.130
You're kidding! I can only withstand one blast!?

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.840
That was a close one, Éclair!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:09.700
Oh, no! The shield is interfering!

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.990
Three...

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.190
...two...

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.390
...one...

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.080
...zero!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.180
Lumiere!

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.440
What!?

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:06.030
By my authority as a GOTT ES member,

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.870
I charge you with being an interstellar criminal.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:12.860
Chief, request authorization to execute an arrest.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:17.540
Approved, Éclair and Lumiere.

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.550
Yes, Ma'am!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:24.550
Arrest me? Are you stupid? Are you planning on arresting a 3-D image?

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:26.640
Haven't you figured it out yet?

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:38.230
Well done with the diversion. Chief, in addition to MAX,

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.830
we've also secured a stronghold into Shopper.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:44.230
Well done, Alv, Dvergr.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:48.800
Do you think you can arrest me without a fight!?

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.510
A gravity bomb!

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:55.180
It's at more than point-blank range!

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:58.080
You won't be able to get away this time!

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:07.190
Wha...

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:10.460
As long as <i>Lumiere-san</i> here can gain access to a target,

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:14.200
she can bring its control systems under her command.

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:16.900
As long as she's this close to it. See?

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:25.210
It's a particularly sturdy briefcase, isn't it?

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.880
I'm particularly proud of this little treasure.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.550
But it has been ruined...

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:31.020
It's all right.

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:38.580
Like I said, I'm particularly proud of this little treasure.

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:49.500
Thanks to your help, young man,

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.340
both of the groups that were encroaching upon my territory

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:55.310
have been neatly eliminated.

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.680
One way or another,

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.510
both MAX and Shopper would have soon brought ruin upon themselves.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:04.680
I couldn't stand to have those guys throwing their weight around here

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.750
with their dirty competition.

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.720
I have to thank you.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:26.210
What pretty stones. What are they?

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:30.640
If I were to say that they were the future of 28 colonies in the area...

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:36.410
...would it make you laugh?

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.490
What are you talking about?

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:43.510
You're a pretentious man, considering the way you look.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.930
With low implantation rates, the rate of deformities

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.160
during development, and diminished immunity,

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:56.170
the microgravity environment here is definitely not gentle on babies.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:21:01.170
Um, we've heard about something...

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:05.340
It's true! We finally have one on this colony!

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.180
The regulated artificial gravity room we've been eagerly waiting for!

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:09.850
- Honey! - Maria!

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:13.910
So then, we can have a baby now the way they do on Earth?

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:18.860
Let's hurry on to the next colony!

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.190
Right!

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:25.730
<i>I'm grateful to you, young man "Wizard."</i>

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:10.460
<i>There is no such thing as complete freedom.</i>

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:13.130
<i>What lies ahead for someone who has escaped captivity is a different cage,</i>

00:23:13.130 --> 00:23:15.800
<i>of another shape.</i>

00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:20.030
<i>Next time on Kiddy Grade</i>
